tinymekf independently implements multiplicative attitude error-state EKF
mathematics: covariance prediction, vector innovations, Joseph covariance
updates, quaternion/bias injection, and error-state covariance reset.
No FilterPy, SciPy, or Vallado source is included. Reference numerical outputs
use FilterPy 2.0.0 and SciPy/NumPy as documented in README.md.
